        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>第2课时 第1课时练习课</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\n    body{\n      margin:0;\n      min-height:100vh;\n      display:flex;\n      justify-content:center;\n      background:#7d8581;\n      font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",serif;\n      color:#353535;\n    }\n    .page{\n      width:540px;\n      min-height:720px;\n      padding:15px 34px 32px 48px;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 24% 32%,rgba(80,80,60,.05),transparent 15%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 70% 68%,rgba(80,80,60,.035),transparent 17%),\n        #f5f2e7;\n      position:relative;\n      box-shadow:0 0 7px rgba(0,0,0,.55);\n      overflow:hidden;\n    }\n    .topline{\n      height:13px;\n      border-top:1px dashed #4f6580;\n      color:#35536c;\n      font-size:9px;\n      display:flex;\n      align-items:flex-start;\n      justify-content:space-between;\n      padding-top:1px;\n      margin-left:-37px;\n      margin-right:-20px;\n    }\n    .topline .unit{margin-left:auto;margin-right:38px;color:#222}\n    .title{\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:17px;\n      letter-spacing:2px;\n      margin:1px 0 4px;\n      font-weight:500;\n    }\n    .columns{\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      column-gap:14px;\n      align-items:start;\n    }\n    .left{padding-right:4px}\n    .right{\n      border-left:1px solid #4d98b2;\n      padding-left:8px;\n      min-height:580px;\n    }\n    .section-title{\n      color:#26709b;\n      font-size:12px;\n      font-weight:bold;\n      margin:2px 0 4px;\n    }\n    p{\n      font-size:11px;\n      line-height:1.7;\n      margin:1px 0;\n    }\n    .indent{padding-left:7px}\n    .line{white-space:nowrap}\n    .blank{\n      display:inline-block;\n      min-width:22px;\n      border-bottom:1px solid #8c8c8c;\n      height:13px;\n      vertical-align:middle;\n    }\n    .work{\n      color:#9c2331;\n      font-family:\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",cursive;\n      font-size:16px;\n      font-weight:500;\n      display:inline-block;\n      transform:rotate(-4deg);\n      white-space:nowrap;\n    }\n    .tinywork{font-size:13px}\n    .calc{\n      margin:2px 0 7px 4px;\n      display:grid;\n      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);\n      gap:2px 7px;\n      font-size:12px;\n      line-height:1.45;\n    }\n    .calc span{white-space:nowrap}\n    .matching{\n      height:250px;\n      position:relative;\n      margin:3px 0 0 0;\n    }\n    .fraction-box{\n      position:absolute;\n      width:37px;height:29px;\n      border:1px solid #777;\n      font-size:11px;\n      text-align:center;\n      line-height:13px;\n      padding-top:1px;\n      background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n    }\n    .fraction-box .bar{\n      width:17px;border-top:1px solid #333;margin:0 auto;\n    }\n    .b1{left:5px;top:1px}.b2{left:77px;top:1px}.b3{left:149px;top:1px}\n    .b4{left:5px;top:180px}.b5{left:77px;top:180px}.b6{left:149px;top:180px}\n    .label{\n      position:absolute;\n      top:93px;\n      width:58px;\n      height:22px;\n      border:1px solid #777;\n      text-align:center;\n      font-size:10px;\n      padding-top:4px;\n      background:#f5f2e7;\n    }\n    .l1{left:34px}.l2{left:125px}\n    svg.lines{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}\n    .problem{margin-bottom:12px}\n    .problem p{line-height:1.72}\n    .answer{\n      margin:2px 0 4px 20px;\n      min-height:26px;\n      color:#a01f2c;\n      font-family:\"KaiTi\",\"STKaiti\",cursive;\n      font-size:17px;\n      transform:rotate(-3deg);\n    }\n    .answer.small{font-size:15px;margin-left:17px}\n    .question{margin-top:4px}\n    .right .section-title{margin-top:2px}\n    .blue-num{color:#26709b;font-weight:bold}\n    .page-no{\n      position:absolute;\n      right:33px;bottom:35px;\n      color:#236d95;\n      font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\n      font-size:12px;\n      font-weight:bold;\n    }\n    .circle{\n      border:2px solid #26709b;border-radius:50%;\n      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n      width:22px;height:22px;margin-right:4px;\n    }\n    .faint{color:#777}\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"topline\"><span>✎</span><span class=\"unit\">6　分数的加法和减法</span></div>\n    <div class=\"title\">第 2 课时　 第 1 课时练习课</div>\n\n    <div class=\"columns\">\n      <section class=\"left\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">1. 填一填。</div>\n        <p class=\"line\">（1）$\\frac{4}{11}+\\frac{5}{11}$ 表示（<span class=\"work\">4</span>）个$\\frac{1}{11}$加上（<span class=\"work\">5</span>）个</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">$\\frac{1}{11}$；1是（<span class=\"work\">9</span>）个$\\frac{1}{\\blank}$。</p>\n\n        <p>（2）计算$\\frac{2}{3}-\\frac{1}{3}$时，因为两个分数的（<span class=\"work\">分母</span>）</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">不同，不能直接相减，所以应先（<span class=\"work\">通分</span>），化</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">成（<span class=\"work\">同分母</span>）分数再相减。</p>\n\n        <p>（3）$\\frac{4}{5}+\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{8}{\\blank}$，$\\frac{3}{8}=\\frac{4}{\\blank}$。</p>\n        <p>（4）分母是 <span class=\"work tinywork\">12</span> 的最简真分数有</p>\n        <p class=\"indent\">（<span class=\"work\">1，2，7，11</span>），它们的和是（<span class=\"work\">2</span>）。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">2. 算一算。</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">\n          <span>$\\frac{5}{8}-\\frac{7}{12}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{15}{24}-\\frac{14}{24}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{1}{7}+\\frac{1}{3}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{4}{5}-\\frac{2}{15}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{4}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{8}{12}+\\frac{3}{12}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{2}{3}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{3}{5}-\\frac{0}{15}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{5}{9}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{6}{9}+\\frac{7}{9}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{3}{8}+\\frac{7}{12}$</span>\n          <span>$\\frac{9}{24}+\\frac{5}{24}$</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"section-title\">3. 连一连。</div>\n        <div class=\"matching\">\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b1\"><div>3</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>5</div></div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b2\"><div>1　3</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>2　7</div></div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b3\"><div>7　3</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>10　5</div></div>\n\n          <div class=\"label l1\">结果大于1</div>\n          <div class=\"label l2\">结果小于1</div>\n\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b4\"><div>2　4</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>3　9</div></div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b5\"><div>22　2</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>27　3</div></div>\n          <div class=\"fraction-box b6\"><div>9　6</div><div class=\"bar\"></div><div>14　7</div></div>\n\n          <svg class=\"lines\" viewBox=\"0 0 205 250\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n            <line x1=\"25\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"103\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"95\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"103\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"166\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"154\" y2=\"103\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"65\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"168\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"154\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"154\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"96\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#a22531\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"right\">\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <p><span class=\"blue-num\">4.</span> 一个西瓜，第一次吃了它的$\\frac{1}{3}$，第二次吃</p>\n          <p>了它的$\\frac{2}{5}$。</p>\n          <p class=\"question\">（1）两次一共吃了它的几分之几？</p>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{11}{15}$</div>\n          <p class=\"question\">（2）还剩下西瓜的几分之几？</p>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$1-\\frac{11}{15}=\\frac{4}{15}$</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <p><span class=\"blue-num\">5.</span> 春天到了，某学校的同学去郊区植树，四</p>\n          <p>年级同学植了总棵数的$\\frac{3}{8}$，五年级同学植</p>\n          <p>了总棵数的$\\frac{3}{5}$。</p>\n          <p class=\"question\">（1）两个年级一共植了总棵数的几分</p>\n          <p>之几？</p>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$\\frac{3}{8}+\\frac{3}{5}=\\frac{39}{40}$</div>\n          <p class=\"question\">（2）你还能提出什么数学问题并解答？</p>\n          <div class=\"answer small\">五年级同学比四年级同学多植总棵数的几分之几？</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$\\frac{3}{5}-\\frac{3}{8}=\\frac{9}{40}$</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">\n          <p><span class=\"blue-num\">6.</span> 佳佳做数学作业用了$\\frac{2}{5}$小时，比做语文作</p>\n          <p>业少用$\\frac{1}{4}$小时，佳佳做这两科作业一共用</p>\n          <p>了多长时间？</p>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{13}{20}$(时)</div>\n          <div class=\"answer\">$\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{13}{20}=\\frac{21}{20}$(时)</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-no\"><span class=\"circle\">69</span>✎</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
